ster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1714510/extras/a6fd9a78ca63cbfe643c6dda77136eb1.poster.avif?t=1752015532\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1714510/extras/a6fd9a78ca63cbfe643c6dda77136eb1.webm?t=1752015532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1714510/extras/a6fd9a78ca63cbfe643c6dda77136eb1.mp4?t=1752015532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "short_description": "Kusan: City of Wolves is a hardcore top-down shooter with tight combat, neo-noir storytelling, and a city as deadly as its people. Battle gangs, corrupt soldiers and psychic threats. You\u2019re not here to save the city of Kusan\u2014just to make sure it doesn\u2019t swallow you whole...",
